UnitStablePool::GetAmountInWithTotalFee
├── when the requested output eq zero
│   └── it should return zero
└── when the requested output is gt zero
    ├── when the requested output is gte the output reserve
    │   └── it should revert with InsufficientLiquidity
    └── when the requested output is lt the output reserve
        ├── it should quote the fee for the curve input from the factory
        ├── it should gross up the zero fee quote by the fee
        ├── it should quote an input that preserves the invariant
        ├── when testing a known example
        │   └── it should return the correct getAmountIn
        ├── when the fee floors to zero
        │   └── it should quote the minimal input
        ├── when quoting with different decimals
        │   └── it should return the correct getAmountIn
        └── when getAmountIn rounds up
            └── it should return the correct getAmountIn
